Hai haaaai~

Well, ahem, dear maze runners!

Glad to say, i'm working on big update right now (to be honest i'm re-creating game from zero, as i planned). So, what would be inside:

[list]
    [*]New UI with gamepad support;
    [*]Language selector (first language to add: Русский);
    [*]Character selector;
    [*]Simple statistics;
    [*]Rich Presence for Steam and Discord;
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30751601/2a9e1c8a9ccc1fdd2b796cdb68caa20ac7bb13cd.png[/img]
[/list]

When build will be in playalable condition, i'll upload it in expiremental bruch and make announcement with link to discord server (to all who care ;;)

In last build will be disabled/removed singleplayer mode and uploaded as free DLC - Multiplayer build.

When SP will be good, i'll look at MP (tho gonna try to make both in same time). I'm sorry ːsquirtmehː

Hey-yo!
As i said before:
[list]
    [*]New UI;
    [*]Optional stamina/helper module;
    [*]Result screen map with player path;
    [*]Several small fixes;
[/list]


This is one of last bug updates (last one will come with 1st extra maze pack), before global update.

I plannig to separate game on two independent part: singleplayer and multiplayer [will come as free DLC]. It will help to work on game without scare about broke something in places which one i didn't touch.

[spoiler]Plus game will be re-created on new UE4 version with new animation packs modes and etc... Ya, 2nd year of EA ;_;[/spoiler]

....next week.

In short:
[list]
    [*]Updated UI;
